\import{macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}
\taxon{Remark}
\title{Conditions for applying a toy model}
\tag{ftip}
\p{A toy theorem applies to a concrete model only if an explicit map from
its state and interface to the model preserves the theorem's assumptions,
including its cost accounting. Without such a map, the conclusion concerns
only the abstract model; its validity for the concrete system is unknown.}
